# the sea. calm and soft: slow sine arpeggios that wash in and out, a warm
# pad under them, no drums at all. D major, drifting to B minor and back.
tempo 66
rows 4

inst wave  sine     vol 0.16 attack 0.02 decay 1.2 sustain 0.0
inst bell  triangle vol 0.10 attack 0.005 decay 1.6 sustain 0.0
inst pad   sine     vol 0.12 attack 0.8 decay 0.8 sustain 0.8 release 1.2 vibrato 0.004
inst bass  sine     vol 0.22 attack 0.1 decay 1.0 sustain 0.6 release 0.8

pattern d
wave  D4 .  A4 .  | F#5 . A4 .  | D4 .  A4 .  | E5 .  A4 .
pad   F#4 . .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .
bass  D2 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | A1 .  .  .

pattern bm
wave  B3 .  F#4 . | D5 .  F#4 . | B3 .  F#4 . | C#5 . F#4 .
bell  .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | F#5 . .  .  | .  .  .  .
pad   D4 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .
bass  B1 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | F#1 . .  .

pattern g
wave  G3 .  D4 .  | B4 .  D4 .  | G3 .  D4 .  | A4 .  D4 .
bell  .  .  .  .  | D5 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .
pad   B3 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .
bass  G1 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | D2 .  .  .

pattern a
wave  A3 .  E4 .  | C#5 . E4 .  | A3 .  E4 .  | E5 .  C#5 .
bell  .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | A5 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .
pad   C#4 . .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  -
bass  A1 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | E2 .  .  .

order d bm g a d bm g d
